<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>骑行 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%AA%91%E8%A1%8C/</link><description>Recent content in 骑行 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%AA%91%E8%A1%8C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>骑行：买二手自行车、换内胎与跟群骑行</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/cycling/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/cycling/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;从看车到骑上路&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：在二手平台约见面试骑、去车店换内胎、跟本地骑行群约周末骑、路上喊话与手势、被司机别了之后怎么处理。主角是你——刚在美国开始骑车的人，配角是卖家 Marcus、车店店员和骑行群的领队 Ryan。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>